l field is null, pass the null up to its nearest nullable parent (or to \"data\")":["Null olamayan bir alan null oldu\u011funda, null de\u011ferini en yak\u0131n null olabilen \u00fcst \u00f6\u011feye (veya \"data\" \u00f6\u011fesine) ilet"],"Pass the null up":["Null de\u011ferini yukar\u0131 ilet"],"Print the field as null":["Alan\u0131 null olarak yazd\u0131r"],"Coerce scalar and enum values?":["Skaler ve enum de\u011ferleri d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcls\u00fcn m\u00fc?"],"Coerce the values of the built-in scalars and of enums to their type (eg: print an ID as a string)":["Yerle\u015fik skaler t\u00fcrlerin ve enum'lar\u0131n de\u011ferlerini kendi t\u00fcrlerine d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr (\u00f6rne\u011fin: bir ID'yi string olarak yazd\u0131r)"],"Coerce the values":["De\u011ferleri d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr"],"Print the values as they are":["De\u011ferleri oldu\u011fu gibi yazd\u0131r"],"Add the response path to errors?":["Hatalara yan\u0131t yolu eklensin mi?"],"Add entry \"path\" to every error, with its position in the response":["Her hataya, yan\u0131ttaki konumunu belirten \"path\" girdisini ekle"],"Add the response path":["Yan\u0131t yolunu ekle"],"Do not add the response path":["Yan\u0131t yolunu ekleme"],"Return no data on request errors?":["\u0130stek hatalar\u0131nda veri d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fclmesin mi?"],"Validate the query before executing it and, if it has errors, return the errors only, without \"data\"":["Sorguyu y\u00fcr\u00fctmeden \u00f6nce do\u011frula ve hata varsa \"data\" olmadan yaln\u0131zca hatalar\u0131 d\u00f6nd\u00fcr"],"Return no data":["Veri d\u00f6nd\u00fcrme"],"Resolve the valid fields":["Ge\u00e7erli alanlar\u0131 \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcmle"],"Follow the GraphQL spec where Gato GraphQL behaves differently, in the Schema Configuration":["\u015eema Yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131'nda, Gato GraphQL'in GraphQL spesifikasyonundan farkl\u0131 davrand\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerlerde spesifikasyonu izleyin"]}}}